## Already built — extend, don't rebuild
- Vendor storefronts, campaign pages (`src/app/campaigns/[slug]/`)
- Order tracking (`src/components/orders/order-status-tracker.tsx`)
- Returns/refunds (`src/lib/jlo/returns.ts` + JLO `return_requests`)
- Distributed fulfilment in JLO (order split, hub dispatch, vendor dispatch)

## Explicitly deferred / minimal
- **#21 Delivery transparency** — exists; polish/marketing only
- **#22 Seller delivery choice** — JLO ops config exists; customer checkout choice in Phase 2B
- **#32 Handmade marketplace** — tags + homepage rail only; full layer is JulineService
- **#35 Corporate purchasing** — Phase 5; start from Request a Quote (#34)

## Repo ownership
- **PWA:** customer trust UX, Protect badge, vendor page, checkout pickup, custom PDP flows
- **JLO:** verifications schema, metrics jobs, disputes backend, ranking, logistics extensions
- **Vendor portal (in JLO):** verification upload, followers, campaigns builder, customisation builder

## Implementation principles
- Minimize scope per phase; pass exit gates before advancing
- Never ship placeholder/fake trust metrics
- Custom orders: one vertical pilot before generic builder
- Reuse campaigns/returns/QR infrastructure rather than parallel systems
